        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\nconfig:\n  layout: dagre\n---\nstateDiagram-v2\n    direction LR\n\n    %% 1. 先定義所有的狀態，使用 &lt;br&gt; 讓中英文分上下兩行顯示\n    PickupNow : pickup_now&lt;br&gt;待派送\n    Delivering : delivering&lt;br&gt;配送中\n    Arrived : arrived&lt;br&gt;已抵達\n    Completed : completed&lt;br&gt;已完成\n    ReturnRejected : rejected_at_door&lt;br&gt;已取消退貨\n    Timeout : returned_timeout&lt;br&gt;逾時(作廢)\n\n    %% 2. 描述流程轉換\n    [*] --&gt; PickupNow: 住戶建立退貨包裹\n\n    PickupNow --&gt; Delivering: 管理員選擇艙門派送\n\n    Delivering --&gt; Arrived: 機器人抵達住戶點位\n\n    Arrived --&gt; Completed: 住戶掃碼開門並放入退貨包裹\n    Arrived --&gt; ReturnRejected: 住戶取消退貨\n    Arrived --&gt; Timeout: 8分鐘未完成掃碼\n\n    %% 3. 結束狀態與後續動作\n    Completed --&gt; [*]: 機器人回到管理室後&lt;br&gt;由管理員取出\n    ReturnRejected --&gt; [*]\n    Timeout --&gt; [*]\n\n    %% 4. 補充註解\n    note right of PickupNow\n        task_type = return\n        以 door_task_id\n        進行艙門分配\n    end note\n\n    note right of Delivering\n        退貨包裹正在運送\n        機器人前往住戶點位\n    end note\n\n    note right of Arrived\n        機器人已抵達\n        顯示 QR Code\n        等待住戶掃碼開門\n    end note&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="bXErjZmzxn8OdvJPvmJd-1">
